nuestro propio negocio.

448
00:21:11,521 --> 00:21:13,690
Ah... Bueno...

449
00:21:13,856 --> 00:21:16,275
Eh, vamos a casa, ¿no?

450
00:21:17,360 --> 00:21:18,403
