459
00:21:43,011 --> 00:21:44,679
[música suena]

460
00:21:50,518 --> 00:21:51,894
[timbre suena]

461
00:21:54,355 --> 00:21:55,940
Cariño, he estado pensando.

462
00:21:56,149 --> 00:21:58,651
