todo se repite, ¿no?

561
00:26:34,427 --> 00:26:35,636
¿Y si subimos?

562
00:26:36,137 --> 00:26:37,388
A ver.

563
00:26:40,725 --> 00:26:43,269
No me deja. No, es
un ascensor de los viejos,

564
00:26:43,352 --> 00:26:45,187
